* 2 Nov 26 dm  New (S.102 stage 4; the owner, 1 Nov: "a cron management admin pane - so that cron can be managed from within SD", admin jobs in its first version).
*              Until now a job was set up only with sudo /usr/local/sbin/sd-elevate job-set at a shell; this verb is what the scheduled jobs page runs.
